Template: winexplorer/set-default
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Make Explorer the default file manager?
 When folders are opened from the desktop, the Start menu or other
 applications, they will open in Explorer instead of the current file
 manager (like choosing a default app in Windows). You can change this
 later from Explorer's Options page, or with: xdg-mime default
 winexplorer.desktop inode/directory
